:: Buy Shield
<<if $gold >= 30>>
<<set $gold -= 30>>
<<set $inventory.push("Iron Shield")>>
<<set $vitality += 2>>
<<set $max_hp += 10>>
<<set $hp += 10>>

Garrett hefts a solid iron shield from the rack. "This'll stop a wolf's bite. Maybe even worse."

''Received: Iron Shield.'' Vitality +2, Max HP +10. Gold remaining: $gold.

[[Back|Garrett]]
<<else>>
"Thirty gold. No haggling."
[[Back|Garrett]]
<</if>>
